sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Viewer as Public Schedule Viewer
    participant API as FRMS API
    participant Store as Timetable Store
    actor Admin as Administrator

    Student->>Viewer: Open public schedule viewer (no login)
    Viewer->>API: Request current week and next four weeks
    API->>Store: Fetch timetable slots and venues
    Store-->>API: Locked slots with venue details
    API->>Store: Fetch approved lectures and statuses
    Store-->>API: Lectures, venues and statuses
    API-->>Viewer: Weekly schedule data
    Viewer-->>Student: Display schedule and venue details
    Note over Viewer: Mark cancelled lectures and "to be confirmed" entries

    opt Staff changes a schedule entry
        Admin->>API: Update lecture, venue or status
        API->>Store: Save approved change
        API->>Viewer: Publish updated schedule
        Viewer-->>Student: Show refreshed public schedule
    end
